Third-Party Notices
===================

This image is the optional arsnova.eu spaCy sidecar (Story 1.14b).
arsnova.eu itself remains MIT-licensed. The bundled model packages are
third-party works and are not relicensed as part of arsnova.eu.

This image is not a pure-MIT artifact: it aggregates MIT, LGPL-LR, and
GPL-3.0 model packages. The models remain replaceable pip wheels
(see requirements.txt).

Included packages
-----------------

- spaCy 3.8.15 (MIT) — https://github.com/explosion/spaCy
- spacy-lookups-data 1.0.5 (MIT) — https://github.com/explosion/spacy-lookups-data
  The Italian lemma lookup is used by the Italian tokenizer pipeline.
- de_core_news_sm 3.8.0 (MIT) — https://github.com/explosion/spacy-models
- en_core_web_sm 3.8.0 (MIT) — https://github.com/explosion/spacy-models
